を入力 : 5\n高さを入力 : 3\n面積は 18.0 です","href":null,"is_same_bp":false}]}},"children":[]},{"blockId":"288a501ef33780798dd1ffa46cfdee30","type":"callout","parent":{"type":"callout","callout":{"color":"default_background","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"答え","href":null,"is_same_bp":false}],"icon":{"type":""}}},"children":[{"blockId":"288a501ef337805cbb2cc054ec3b931a","type":"code","parent":{"type":"code","code":{"language":"python","caption":[],"parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"# ユーザーから入力された台形の上底、下底と高さをもとに、台形の面積を求め出力してください。\n# ただし、引数として上底、下底と高さを受け取り、戻り値としてその台形の面積を返すfind_daikei関数を作成し、プログラム中で使用してください\n\ndef find_daikei(jt, kt, tk):\n    return (jt + kt) * tk / 2\n\nprint(\"台形の面積を求めます\")\njotei = int(input(\"上底を入力 : \"))\nkatei = int(input(\"下底を入力 : \"))\ntaka  = int(input(\"高さを入力 : \"))\nprint(\"面積は\", find_daikei(jotei, katei, taka), \"です\")","href":null,"is_same_bp":false}]}},"children":[]}]},{"blockId":"28aa501ef33780388c2af6a1a9a37622","type":"heading_1","parent":{"type":"header","header":{"color":"default","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"問題3","href":null,"is_same_bp":false}],"is_toggleable":false}},"children":[]},{"blockId":"28aa501ef337809288b8c85dcb052436","type":"paragraph","parent":{"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"color":"default","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"引数として受け取ったリストの平均値を求めて返す","href":null,"is_same_bp":false},{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":true,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"find_average","href":null,"is_same_bp":false},{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"defau